window.products.push({"id":337157,"name":"Torkia - Statue of Liberty USA Flag Designed Statue Figurine (15.5\" inches Tall)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j+b6iluUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Torkia - Statue of Liberty USA Flag Designed Statue Figurine. An exclusive merchandise souvenir, designed, made and manufactured only by Torkia International Inc. This exclusive souvenir item showcases the Iconic Statue of Liberty in a Figurine Form. The Statue of Liberty (Liberty Enlightening the World; French: La Liberté éclairant le monde) is a colossal neoclassical sculpture on Liberty Island in New York Harbor in New York City, in the United States. The copper statue is a gift from the people of France to the people of the United States and was designed by French sculptor Frédéric Auguste Bartholdi. Standing 305 feet (93 meters) high including its pedestal, it represents a woman holding a torch in her raised right hand and a tablet bearing the adoption date of the Declaration of Independence (July 4, 1776) in her left. The Statue of Liberty is one of the most iconic landmarks not only in New York but throughout the world and is a representation of universal freedom. A tourist attraction to all who visit NYC. This Statue is made with Polyresin Material. The statue of liberty figurine is built with many inscriptions’ details and text inscriptions such as \" New York\" \"Statue of Liberty\" and \"Torkia\". This Figurine imitates the real-life Statue of Liberty detail by detail from the crown, torch, \"JULY IV MDCCLXXVI\" tablet and other notable things associated with the Statue of Liberty. These Figurines range from various sizes to choose from. This set of figurines are also designed with the USA Flag Colors and Stars. A Figurine Statue like this, is great to place in any setting such as home, office, desk or even to just collect. Makes a great personal gift for anyone especially New York lovers and tourists. Please handle with care as Item is Fragile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j+b6iluUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Torkia International Inc.","source_asin":"B09QTXJSPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QTXJSPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QTXJSPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
