window.products.push({"id":337266,"name":"Calphalon Traditional 2-Piece Chef's and Santoku Knife Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J591PPEML._AC_.jpg","description":"Each Calphalon Traditional knife is fully forged from a single piece of German high-carbon stainless steel that takes and holds a fine edge and that won't rust, stain, or discolor. Additional balance and strength come from the full, visible tang running through the handle, which is formed of hygienic, fiberglass-reinforced poly that won't crack, split, or chip and is attached to the tang with the traditional three rivets. This two-piece knife set features an 8-inch chef's knife and a 5-inch Santoku knife. The 8-inch chef's knife provides a curved blade, which is ideal for rocking through a chopping or mincing task, as well as for all-purpose cutting. Its broad blade is tapered from spine to edge and from heel to tip, with a bolster providing balance and safety. Resembling something between a chef's knife and a cleaver, the 5-inch Santoku knife in an all-purpose Asian-style knife. The word \"santoku\" means three good things--a reference to the three cutting tasks it performs so well: slicing, dicing, and mincing. Small, oval-shaped indentations along its sharp edge reduce friction and prevent food from adhering to its sides, which results in continuous cutting and increased efficiency. The chef's knife measures approximately 12 inches long and the Santoku knife measures approximately 9 inches long. Made in Germany, both knives carry a lifetime warranty against defects and should be washed by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J591PPEML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B000B1LU16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B1LU16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B1LU16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
