window.products.push({"id":337364,"name":"Cube Memory Foam Pillow Side Sleeper Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain(24\"x12\"x4\", Thin), Cooling Bed Pillow for Side Sleeping, Soft and Supportive Ce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wjV-W-cyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICALLY FOR SIDE SLEEPERS: Side sleepers often suffer neck and shoulder pain from improper thickness or unsupportive pillows. This bed pillow is designed for side sleepers. Our side sleeper pillow is made of high-quality memory foam that will full fill the 90°space between your neck and shoulders, aligning your spine. 4 inch cube pillow works best for slender side sleepers who have more narrow shoulders, please measure your shoulder depth before purchasing for the best fit PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM: This pliable 45D memory foam provides moderately soft and firm, perfectly fits into your neck curve and reduces the pressure on your shoulders, keeping the spinal column in your neck and back aligned properly. The slow rebound high-density memory foam is soft but supportive and retains its shape and firmness after being used night after night WASHABLE AND REMOVABLE COOLING COVER: The outer cover is made of ice silk fabric which is woven from polyester fiber and wood pulp fiber, which has good moisture absorption and breathability, keeping the square pillow dry and fresh. It is smooth and cool to the touch, giving you a refreshing sleep even in summer. The dust-proof inner cover extends the life of the memory foam core more effectively. The cover of this rectangle pillow is designed with zipper, it's easy to dismantle and clean Multipurpose: This cube memory foam pillow is not just a bed pillow for sleeping, also can be used as a couch pillow, car pillow, leg and knee pillow, back cushion, lumbar pillow for napping, traveling, camping, working, sleeping, reading, etc. Pillow is 24 inches long, perfect for spooning WORRY-FREE WARRANTY: OMYSTYLE is committed to providing you with premium products for improving your quality of life. If you have any questions, please contact us in exchange for a new one or a full refund. We provide 30-day return and replacement service & 2-year of friendly customer service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wjV-W-cyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OS OMYSTYLE","source_asin":"B0BPBXM1PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBXM1PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBXM1PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
