window.products.push({"id":337453,"name":"Zassenhaus Berlin Wood Mill Refillable Manual Salt Grinder, 4.7 Inches, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vfIrHYUnL._AC_SL1283_.jpg","description":"BERLIN WOODEN GRINDER: A timeless bestseller, the Zassenhaus Berlin mill brings classic beauty and style to your kitchen or dining room table. To suit your personal preference, they are made from meticulously selected solid beechwood in either a dark stained or a natural finish. PRECISION GERMAN SALT MILL: The Zassenhaus salt mill features a ceramic grinding mechanism that is made in Germany, and is harder than carbon steel and won't dull or corrode over time. Each time you use this exceptional refillable mill, your spice is coarsely cracked and then finely cut. We offer a 25-year warranty on this superior grinding mechanism. PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIALS: This hand grinder is made in Europe from meticulously selected solid beechwood and is available in either a dark stained or a natural finish to suit your personal preference. It has a stainless steel spindle for uniform spice output and a ceramic grinding mechanism. This high end refillable mill will elevate your home kitchen experience. EASY TO USE ADJUSTABLE SALT MILL: This refillable mill features a numbered dial that lets you adjust from a coarse to an ultra-fine grind. You get the perfect granule every time. To adjust the granule size, rotate the adjustment tab clockwise or counterclockwise for finer or coarser granules. To fill, unscrew the knob, remove the top, and pour in your favorite salt. Replace the top and knob and turn the top of the mill clockwise to grind. To clean, simply wipe the exterior with a damp cloth. ZASSENHAUS TRADITION: Founded in 1867, Zassenhaus has become the epitome of high quality spice and coffee mills. They know that enjoyment and quality of life are more related to the kitchen and cooking than almost anything else. That's why Zassenhaus combines classic, timeless styles with reliable functionality and innovative design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vfIrHYUnL._AC_SL1283_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zassenhaus","source_asin":"B09PGYKS8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PGYKS8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PGYKS8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
