window.products.push({"id":337474,"name":"1DOT2 Floating Picture Frames, 6x8 Double Glass Photo Frame Black, Made of Solid Wood Floating Display for Photos 2x3, 5x7, 4x6 or Full Display for 6x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7ldY7jLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Floating Picture Frames】1DOT2 6x8 floating picture frame display size for the floating picture frames is 4x6. The outer frames size is 8.65in x 6.65in, and the inner frame size is 7.7in x 5.7in. You can also use the photo frame to fits for 2x3, 3.5x5, 4x6 or 5x7 photos in the center (up to 6x8 photos) to make an illusion for the photos look like floating. It can be displayed vertically and horizontally tabletop or ONLY vertically on the wall. 【Eco-friendly Pine Wood Design】Our picture frames are made of New Zealand pine wood molding, wood grain finish. It is different from the ones made of PS or MDF, It has a consistent even texture, has good resistance to splitting. Wood picture frames are a beautiful addition to any artwork. We picked the highest quality moldings in an effort to bring your artwork, photos, landscape pictures, prints to lives 【Top-rated MATERIAL】The double sided glasses front cover protects the pictures from dust, which can block a certain percentage of UV light, providing a clear view of the photos underneath. The glass is scratch resistant and will not bow. This is easily remedied via little bit of hot glue or tape, if the pictures start to move around after placed the double-sided glass into the frames 【Multi-purpose & Wall Decor】 This floating wood picture frame has a classic style and elegant appearance. You can use the floating picture frame to display photos, postcards, stamps, you can display DIY works (such as cut newspapers and magazines, dried flower etc.), You can also display the footprints of newborn babies, couples handprints. It is impressive gifts for friends or family, weddings, anniversary, birthday, Mother's Day, wedding, baby shower, Valentine's Day, Christmas 【Well-Packaged &customer satisfied】Each Picture Frame has been wrapped very carefully in a 3-layer hard carton to ensure safe shipping. 1DOT2 provide fast & professional customer service, please do not hesitate to send us your issues for replacement or refund if you are not completely satisfied. 24 online service is here always! Once your framed art is on the wall, you will be able to enjoy it for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7ldY7jLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1DOT2","source_asin":"B0B72P6KQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B72P6KQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B72P6KQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
