window.products.push({"id":337476,"name":"SunStyle Home 4 Pieces Bed Sheets Set, Soft Microfiber Bedding Sheet Set Ivory Jersey Knit Sheet Set, Full Size Hotel Luxury Bed Sheets - Breathable, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZqmL61KNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% Micofiber Imported EXTRA SOFT& COMFY- This hotel luxury FULL size bedding knit sheet set is very close-fitting, made of extra soft and skin-friendly high quality knitted fabric. The jersey knit sheets are softer, smoother, more resilient and more breathable than even the finest Egyptian cotton to bring you a comfortable and relaxing night's sleep environment here, make you sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. MOISTURE WICKING& COOLING - This Knit Sheet Set is designed to be very breathable and moisture-wicking which allows your body to feeling cool and relaxed throughout the night to wake up feeling refreshed. Breathable sheets feature superior thermal regulation by wicking moisture away to keep you feel warm in winter and cool in summer for deeper sleep experience. GOOD ELASTIC- The fabric has good elastic and is very durable. The sheet set is knitted, it has better elasticity than woven sheet set. Wrinkles will disappear soon after washing. The microfiber material is processed to make it resistant to shrinkage and fading which adds to the longevity of the set by keeping it in great condition. WHAT YOU CAN GET- 4 piece Full size sheet sets include : 1 lvory Flat Sheet（81*96\"）, 1 lvory Fitted Sheet（54*75*16\"）,2 lvory Pillowcase（20*30\"）. Deep pocket fitted sheet with elastic all around so that can effortlessly grips any mattress up to 16''（fits 6-16 inch mattress,The pillowcase with a ELASTIC BAND creates a no-slip that suit for all adjustable pillow. EASY TO CARE- Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. SUNSTYLE HOME Highly concerned about your shopping experience, we provide 30 days Unconditional refund. Glad to serve you 24/7, if you have any question, just feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZqmL61KNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunStyle Home","source_asin":"B0832RMFDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0832RMFDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0832RMFDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":337477,"name":"Emile Henry Modern Classics Sugar Rectangular Baker, 13\" x 9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Q1Oz+PmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for vegetable gratins, baked pasta dishes, fruit crisps and more, this handsome baker pairs a modern sensibility with time-honored French construction techniques. Produced one at a time, each piece of Emile Henry’s Modern Classics collection is formed and hand-finished by skilled artisans. FEATURESThe first major release from Emile Henry in over two decades, the Modern Classics collection is only available at Sur La Table. The product of over two years of development, Modern Classics pairs Emile Henry’s signature Burgundy clay and French construction techniques with shapes designed specifically for the American kitchen. With unmatched even heating capabilities, Burgundy clay is safe for broiler and microwave use and is oven safe to 500°F. Highly resistant to thermal shock, Emile Henry cookware moves directly from freezer to oven. Attractive, scratch-resistant glazes feature colors inspired by nature, are lead and cadmium free, and provide an ultra-smooth, virtually nonstick cooking surface that makes cleanup a snap. A high firing temperature results in incredibly durable cookware that resists chipping. Manufacturer: Emile Henry. Material: Burgundy clay. Care: Dishwasher safe. Use: Oven safe to 500°F. Dimensions: 13\" x 9\" x 3\". Capacity: 4.7 qt.. Warranty: 10-year warranty. Made in France.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Q1Oz+PmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B016IGC89A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016IGC89A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016IGC89A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
