window.products.push({"id":337481,"name":"Half Cookie Sheet Pan for Baking - HONGBAKE Nonstick Baking Sheet with Diamond Texture Surface, 57% Thicker Carbon Steel Commercial Cookie Trays for O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oyg7uDEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INGENUITY DIAMOND TEXTURE - This half sheet pan has a diamond texture on the base increases its non-stick properties and ensures even and quick heat airflow to the cookie, which makes the cookies consistently baked without any over or undercooked parts. PREMIUM EXTRA-THICK MATERIAL - With 57% thicker carbon steel, these durable oven trays are constructed from heavy-gauge carbon steel for stability, even heat distribution, and durability for years to come. Warranty against peeling off with heat-resistance temperature: 450℉. A HEALTHIER BAKING CHOICE - The Whitford-reinforced for exceptional release, the two-layer coating is chemical-free – PFOA, BPA and PTFE. It is thus safe to use. In addition, it has a smooth, non-stick surface thanks to a 34% silicon content that makes it a breeze to clean while protecting against scratching, staining, and corrosion. VARIOUS CUISINE AT WILL- This nonstick 17.5x11.8 baking sheet is designed for commercial and family, inner sizes:17x11x1 inches, outer sizes:17.5 x 11.8x 1 inches. It is a perfect size for baking cookies, pastries, lasagna, jelly rolls, chicken and vegetables, etc. Just one can easily satisfy your daily baking needs and help you take your baking to the next level EXQUISITE TABLE ART - The fact that your baking pan is not only a practical baking tool but also an affordable table art. Great kitchen utensils should be made with quality and aesthetics in mind. Our unique champagne gold baking dish is the perfect combination of them, adding elegant aesthetics to your dining table. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – We are sure that our nonstick cookie sheet will win your heart with its simple design, classic colors, and versatility! If you have a fair concern, please contact us, we will provide 365 days of service and reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oyg7uDEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HONGBAKE","source_asin":"B0B5QTHCTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5QTHCTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5QTHCTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":337482,"name":"EHM Ultra Premium Alkaline water Filter Pitcher - 3.8L, Activated Carbon Filter- BPA Free, Healthy, Clean, & Toxin-Free Mineralized Alkaline Water in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613rlVqt+FS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATER JUST GOT A WHOLE LOT BETTER: It's the 21st century. We've used our mastery of technology to improve every other aspect of our life - so why should water be any different? That's the line of thinking that led us to the creation of the EHM Alkaline Water Pitcher, and mineralized alkaline water. Not only does it have great health benefits, it also has a fresh and delicious natural taste! GREATLY IMPROVED HYDRATION: By micro-clustering and reducing water molecule size, this great water ionizer pitcher produces easily-absorbable alkaline water that will get you hydrated faster and more effectively. Filtered alkaline ionized water contains minimal free radicals and toxins, is a powerful antioxidant and enhances your energy levels and immune system. FILTER CARTRIDGE: By utilizing a specially formulated filter, the EHM Alkaline Water Counter Top Filter removes chlorine, heavy metals, and other contaminants from water, sets its pH to a basic value between 8.5 and 10 depending on the source water. It also adds calcium, magnesium, and potassium minerals and anti-oxidants, and provides a low negative ORP between -100 and -200 mv. PREMIUM QUALITY: When it comes to our EHM Alkaline Water Filter Purifiers, we make a point of using nothing but the finest materials available, as well as state-of-the-art manufacturing processes and strict quality control.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613rlVqt+FS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EHM","source_asin":"B093N56CGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093N56CGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093N56CGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
