window.products.push({"id":337538,"name":"Farmhouse Bathroom Signs Decor 3PCS, PVC Made Waterproof Restroom Wall Decor, Duplex Printed Rustic Farmhouse Bathroom Wall Decor, Fade-Resistant Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812zLdCRwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Waterproof PVC Material for Long-Term Use] Made of premium PVC material, our bathroom signs decor feature a good waterproof character for high-humidity environments. Aside from that, the smooth surface also performs well for waterproofing. It keeps the water vapor out of the signs, helping the drops of water slide down easily when splashed onto the signs. Unlike bathroom signs with wood frames, these PVC bath decor will not be corroded by the water, nor will they burst with a bad smell. [Duplex Printed with UV-Treated Ink for an All-round Display] To maximize the appreciation experience, all of our bathroom signs wall decors are printed in the same pattern on both sides. Coupled with high-definition technology and UV-treated ink, the pattern is very clean and clear, and the signs are fade-resistant to remain vivid for a long time. Thus bathroom wall art can prevent oxidation and fading caused by prolonged exposure to light, making them well-suited for long-term displays. [Rustic Farmhouse Bathroom Decor] In addition to the simple and generous text form, the bathroom art wall decors have incorporated a rustic wood grain to the background, adding a rustic farmhouse atmosphere to the original dull words pattern. Decorating these farmhouse decors in your bathroom, restroom, toilet, or any other place gives your home a rustic, country feel, and helps set up some basic bathroom rules in a relaxed atmosphere, especially for the kids. [3 PCS Bathroom Signs Set] Each package consists of 3 different signs, namely \"wash your hands\", \"brush your teeth\", and \"comb your hair\", with each measuring 5x12 inches. An adequate quantity and different patterns for nicely filling wall space and providing a wide choice for farmhouse bathroom wall decor by hanging them together or scattered about. There are also 12 transparent double-sided stickers along with the package, which you can use to conveniently attach the signs to the walls. [Easy Installation in Multiple Ways] You can choose from a variety of ways to install bathroom decor wall art. We have punched 4 small holes in each sign so that you can hang them with fine ropes or fix them with screws through the holes. Double-sided tapes are also convenient and simple to hang or remove, without destroying or scratching the place. There is no need to worry about accidentally scratching your hands too while installing since the edge of the sign is polished smoothly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812zLdCRwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EastLink","source_asin":"B0BWHHGVXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWHHGVXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWHHGVXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
