window.products.push({"id":337599,"name":"Emoji Backpack Party Favor Bags for Kids Birthday - Set of 24 Drawstring Backpack Goodie Bags, Treat Bags, Return Gifts, Teacher Supplies, or Emoji Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iab8wmNyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester lining Drawstring closure 13\" shoulder drop The Most \"Real\" Emoji Party Favor Bags Ever! - The more you look at their sparkling eyes and cheeky faces, the more you can begin to see the REAL faces that kids love about these treat bags, can’t you? And imagine being the kid that opens up this emoji-tastic string backpack to find it full of candy and emoji party supplies! Notice, It's Stronger Too - I know you’re wondering if these are like those other Emoji drawstring bags that fray and break. Our party bags are 210D Polyester, with more stitches per inch, reinforced corners and 0.2 in. thick string, and so are much stronger for daily use. Matching mini family day packs anyone? Super Cute Emojis - We designed these Emoji bags ourselves! I want you to look at every wink and smile and see how alive all 12 of them are, because some emoji party bags are plain, or just plain scary. If you want a set of 12 loot bags or party favors for kids with the most fun and creative designs – we made these just for you. Fits Everything You Want - These Emoji Drawstring Backpacks are 12 x 15 inches and hold up to 5lbs of party loot. They hold up to 5lbs of my son’s school field trip findings and will fit all the goody toys you have lined up! They’re also used for Christmas stockings, teachers gift, teacher supplies, birthday party supplies, Valentines Day gifts for kids, and return gifts. Guaranteed Fun - You could also take these emojis to the beach, couldn’t you? Look, while you can’t fit large beach towels, you CAN fit other things or toddler stuff without worrying about sand – just brush or rinse it! Now, maybe you can see these are the quality emojis you want entertaining your people! And if not, we’ll use your 3-Month Guarantee to either refund your money, or send in reinforcements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iab8wmNyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kids RMore","source_asin":"B07WFQWKTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFQWKTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFQWKTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
