window.products.push({"id":337806,"name":"Silverstro Orange Deer String Lights, 10 Ft 30 LED USB & Battery Powered Fairy Lights with Remote Control and Timer, LED Lights for Kid's Room Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kg5MNn+wL._AC_SL1414_.jpg","description":"Christmas Reindeer String Lights That You Must Not Miss - The reindeer will come to your house with Santa Claus and give you Christmas gifts. Hang this Christmas reindeer in your home, let your children look forward to them carrying Santa Claus to your house at night, hang the gift on the reindeer lights, and give them gifts. Keep your child's innocence and story. Perfect Christmas Decorations - The fairy LED Christmas lights are very charming and beautiful, with glamor lights will attract guests or neighbors' attention easily, ideal for Christmas, New Year's, and Thanksgiving, both indoors and outdoors, you can use them decorate your Christmas wreaths, Christmas trees, paths, trees, eaves, gardens, and more. 8 Dimming Mode and Memory Function - Including combination, in wave, sequential, slo glo, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, steady on. Different modes are suitable for different occasions. The Christmas reindeer strings are added to the timing function. The built-in storage chip can save your last mode settings, which is simple and convenient to use. USB Cord & 3AA Battery Powered - You can use battery power to place the orange reindeer Christmas light string anywhere. USB power supplies free you up from the hassles of replacing batteries, with the added benefit of lowering the cost of maintenance and being better for the environment. Flexible and Durable Christmas Lights - Adopted high quality silver-plated copper wire, tough 2 strands twisted into 1 strand to avoid getting tangled and broken. The wire is also flexible and bendable, this allows you easy to DIY or shape around gifts, plants, stairs, balconies, signs, wheels, furniture, and almost everything else.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kg5MNn+wL._AC_SL1414_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silverstro","source_asin":"B08NCPWMHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NCPWMHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NCPWMHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":337807,"name":"NILEEBUKER 7.8“L Gold Brass Eagle Spread Wings Statue Animal Bird Sculpture Art Home Office Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JR1WxzP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature: 1,Material: Superior high quality brass.2,Technology: Better lost-wax casting and polishing to ensure produce exquisite statues.3,Coloring: Skilled thermal coloring technology, smooth surface, clear design.4,Packaging: Inner with soft waterproof and shockproof foam, plastic and blanket, outside with hard carton. Check details carefully before shipment.5,Occasion: Perfect collectible figurine and classy indoor decor display atop any shelf, cabinet or table in home, office or show room and so on, also perfect gift for birthday and festival to family and friend. Tips and suggestions: 1,If you receive an incorrect, damaged, defective or item not as described, please contact us for partial/full refund or replacement on our cost.2,All the items are taken photos in real, because of lighting and background, pictures and real color may have a little difference, so goods colors prevail in kind received. Statue cleaning and protection methods: 1,Surface: Rub a dry cotton cloth gently over the entire bronze object to remove dust, always apply light pressure to the bronze.2,Gap: Scrub the entire bronze object gently with a soft brush to remove grime, focus on crevices in the bronze where grime collects.3,Wax: apply wax to the bronze, begin by dipping a new, one-inch-wide paintbrush into clear paste wax. apply only a small amount of wax to paintbrush. sweep the paintbrush gently over the bronze surface again and again. lightly coat the entire bronze surface, including the crevices, with a thin layer of the paste wax. let the wax dry according to the product's directions.4,Wipe: Buff the bronze statues gently with a dry cloth to remove wax residue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JR1WxzP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NILEEBUKER","source_asin":"B09ZV9BQQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-337807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZV9BQQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZV9BQQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
